    "weekday_happy_hour": "🍺 {day_of_week} Happy Hour — 5-7 PM! 🌊\n\nBuy 2 Beers, Get 1 FREE 🍺🍺→🍺\nBecause one round is never enough.\n\n[HAPPENING TODAY — sports, food feature, vibe]\n\n🍔 Full kitchen open: Slavic classics, seafood, burgers, shawarma\n⚽ [Sports schedule if applicable]\n🏖️ Ocean views, 14 drafts, 150\" screen\n\n📍 3152 Brighton 6th St, Brooklyn\n⏰ Open 5 PM – 1 AM\n\nTag your after-work crew 👇\n\n{hashtags}",
    "friday_kickoff": "🌊 WEEKEND MODE: ACTIVATED 🍺\n\n[HOOK — weekend energy]\n\n🍺 Happy Hour 5-7 PM: Buy 2 Get 1 FREE\n⚽ Sports all weekend on our 150\" screen\n🍔 Full menu: Slavic classics, seafood, burgers, shawarma\n\n📍 Brighton Beach Boardwalk\n⏰ Tonight 5 PM – 1 AM | Sat-Sun 12 PM – 1 AM\n\nTag who you're bringing 👇\n\n{hashtags}",
    "saturday_open": "🍺 IT'S A BOARDWALK SATURDAY! 🌊\n\nDoors open at noon — beach, beers, big screens.\n\n[TODAY'S VIBE HOOK]\n\n🍺 14 drafts flowing\n⚽ [Game schedule if applicable]\n🍔 Kitchen firing all day\n\n📍 3152 Brighton 6th St, Brooklyn\n⏰ Open 12 PM – 1 AM\n\n{hashtags}",
    "atmosphere": "[HOOK — what's happening right now]\n\n🍺 Cold drafts, hot kitchen, big screens\n⚽ [Sports action description]\n\nEvery seat has ocean views. Every pour is ice cold.\n\n📍 Boardwalk Beer Garden — Brighton Beach\n⏰ Open till 1 AM\n\n{hashtags}",
    "night_vibes": "🌙 The Boardwalk after dark…\n\n[MOOD DESCRIPTION]\n\n🍺 Late-night pours\n🍔 Kitchen open late\n🎵 Vibes till 1 AM\n\n📍 Brighton Beach, Brooklyn\n\n{hashtags}",
    "sunday_funday": "☀️ Sunday Funday at the Boardwalk 🌊\n\n[CHILL VIBE HOOK]\n\n🍺 Cold drafts all day\n🍔 Full menu: brunch faves + full kitchen\n⚽ Sports on every screen\n\n📍 Brighton Beach, Brooklyn\n⏰ Open 12 PM – 1 AM — make it count!\n\n{hashtags}",
    "food_feature": "🍽️ [DISH NAME] at Boardwalk Beer Garden 🍺\n\n[FOOD DESCRIPTION — what makes it special]\n\nPair it with one of our 14 drafts. Trust us.\n\n📍 3152 Brighton 6th St, Brooklyn\n⏰ [Today's hours]\n\n{hashtags}",
